      <tr><td>1. Header</td><td>Your Name + Photo</td><td>header, h1, img</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2. Nav</td><td>Home, About, Skills, Contact</td><td>nav, a</td></tr>
      <tr><td>3. About</td><td>2 lines about you</td><td>section, h2, p</td></tr>
      <tr><td>4. Skills</td><td>Your 3 skills</td><td>section, ul, li</td></tr>
      <tr><td>5. Marks Table</td><td>Your marks</td><td>section, table, tr, th, td</td></tr>
      <tr><td>6. Contact Form + Footer</td><td>Name, Email, Message</td><td>section, form, input, textarea, footer</td></tr>
    </table>
    <h2>4. Full Code - Copy This And Change Your Name</h2>
    <p>Copy this full code in Playground and change the name, skills and marks to yours:</p>
